{"server":"tw","storyId":"act23side_level_act23side_st02","groupId":"act23side","stageId":"act23side_st02","title":"信我所信","storyCode":"WB-ST-2","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act23side/level_act23side_st02.txt","sourceHash":"2283cb34c2923b741fa54679ecb8de6e7c0b8475121aa1337ed21bebf1161e6b","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"左樂終於攔下了截雲，行事乖張的槐天裴再次阻止了他。林雨霞根據種種線索以及眾人的反應，逐漸推測出了這一系列事情的全貌。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g11_yumendesert"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g3_yumenobservationtower_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事情就是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"劍在槐武癡手裡，以他的武功，左樂估計拿他沒辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為這一個約定，他竟然在城裡等了三年......倒是個有趣的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太合的傷勢怎樣了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還沒醒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"重傷太合先生的和前天刺殺魏彥吾的是同一人。她趁亂逃走，我不是對手，沒能追上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在左樂封了鑄劍坊，不少武人都被......控制了起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天災當前，現在守軍和江湖人士又徹底撕破臉，玉門的局勢只怕會更亂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也不能怪他衝動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......這件事，你自己不出手，解決不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"左將軍讓我留守軍營，我明目張膽跟他作對算怎麼回事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道我說的不只是這幾天的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你馬上就要離開，臨行前總要給城裡的那些仰慕著你的人一個交代。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是你覺得，解釋不清的事，回避就夠了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家都當你是我的學生，有時候連我自己都忘了你的來歷，也將你當作錄武官、左樂一輩的孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我從沒叫過你一聲“老師”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也的確不能算是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的悟性很高，劍術多半是靠自己琢磨，我能教你的，本來就有限。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟是你對所有人隱瞞了我的身份，讓我能留在玉門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總不能看著一個孩子再流落荒野......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你從來不擔心我會動手殺你？還是認定我永遠都贏不了你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要想報仇，又何必要在武功上勝過我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算往飯裡下毒，或者是在這城牆上推我一把，我也該死了千百遍了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只怕你殺了我，也沒法放下執念。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果不是跟在你身邊五年，聽到這種話，我一定會大罵你是世上最道貌岸然的偽君子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"五年，竟然有這麼久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從你的視角看，未必是多長的一段時間吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這又怎麼說？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"十幾年過去，一個人的相貌沒有半點改變，臉上也總是掛著這副世事看盡的無奈表情，我再遲鈍，也該明白你不是普通人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"知道這片大地上有一些壽命極長的種族，以前只是當故事聽，沒想到就在自己的身邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你早就想到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是不太在乎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只為報仇，你能活多長和我沒有關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更何況，總想著你不是普通人，不就等於在為自己找藉口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像你說的，徒步登高，只需要一步一步往上走就好了。其他的事情，想多了只是干擾心志。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但一心惦記著恩怨、輸贏，就算真的得償所願，未必就能放下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"劍上承載的雜念太多，就會變得遲緩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"普通人，總得靠那一點執念活著......你又何嘗不清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得剛認識的時候，你說話還沒這麼“咄咄逼人”......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這五年，我畢竟受了你不少教誨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我教你的，只是習武的心得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是你說的，你能教的有限，但學到的比教的多，也是各人的造化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"話說回來，你總該去見見那些還記掛著你的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是太多人的執念了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g9_yumensuburb"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截雲","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個大塊頭不見了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"站住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截雲","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又是你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然姑娘不是那夥賊人的同夥，又為何要偷劍？醫館那人和你又是什麼關係？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截雲","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不認識他們，我也不知道那人是誰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"顯然你不清楚自己捲進了多大的麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你沒在移動城市生活過，對玉門一無所知。有人告訴了你這把劍的位置，利用你將它盜走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但這會招惹來怎樣的麻煩，你並不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告訴我，事情或許還有挽回的餘地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截雲","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說過了，沒有誰指示，我只是為了報恩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕自己會丟掉性命？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截雲","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......反正你別再跟著我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管真相如何，我不能坐視一個無關的人因此陷入險境。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是在救你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截雲","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截雲","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘴上說得再好聽也沒用。你不是個好人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我奉命追查，你盜劍在先，即使有些隱情，也不該顛倒黑白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截雲","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就看你下令把工坊的那些師傅都抓去軍營，你就不值得相信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們試圖掩護山海眾逃離鑄劍坊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截雲","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們是去保護那裡的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在嫌疑沒有洗清之前，一應人等都需嚴查。天災當前，賊寇作亂，我要對玉門負責。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截雲","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我的部族，只有年滿十六歲、身體強壯的阿納薩，族人才會為他打造專門的武器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截雲","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"得到武器的阿納薩，就要永遠保護老人小孩，和生病的同胞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截雲","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說是不能看著無關的人陷入險境，說是為了保護一座城市，就可以輕易將武器對準普通人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"左樂職責在身......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截雲","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"師父說得對，你們這些人，因為有冠冕堂皇的理由可以說，就不覺得自己做錯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還特地放慢了速度，結果一回頭發現人沒有跟上來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"劍還在我手上，你倆反倒聊起來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，左樂與二位有些誤會，希望你可以交出佩劍，物歸原主。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽你們吵了半天，大概明白了意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"此劍原來是那位宗師的東西，但是被這位小姑娘給偷偷帶走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他的武功出神入化，肯定不依賴哪一件具體的兵器。難道還能是他捨不得這把劍，派你來追的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其中隱秘，不方便告知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是給他添了麻煩，那他卸任的日子又得往後拖......但我也答應過要幫這個小姑娘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......難辦，難辦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大道理我懶得管，我倒有個直截了當的辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們都算有點功夫，不如就在這打一架。都不許用武器，比拳頭，誰贏了，我就把劍給誰。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"荒唐。蒼生大事，豈能兒戲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是不會動手的——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截雲","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我趕時間。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g04_yaninn"},{"type":"narration","text":"梅花五點，拳腳相通；來留去送，甩手直衝。\n寸內發勁，力有對錯；意投於外，一點精神......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"narration","text":"天濛濛亮，客棧裡的夥計才開始擦桌掃地，準備今日伙房要用的食材。\n老鯉剛起床，後院已經傳來羽獸晨鳴，以及，陣陣拳風。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"終究是父女，緣分哪......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"漂亮，漂亮。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鯉叔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有段時間沒見過你打這套拳了，還以為你是忽然參透了什麼心法，到了無招勝有招的境界。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鯉叔又說玩笑話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"武功可不是這麼玄乎的東西，想要進步，只有靠日復一日的苦練。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說得有理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還記得第一次讓你幫事務所跑腿，就招惹到了一群不太規矩的幫派。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等我反應過來趕到的時候，只看到你站在倒了一地的黑幫打手中間，像個沒事人一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那時候你才十六歲......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在還沒有太學會說話的時候，就已經開始習武了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼早的事也能記得？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是他告訴我的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少在這方面，他把你教得很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老話都說，“師父領進門，修行看個人”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，其實“領進門”也是很重要的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能在他看來，這是作為父親，唯一能為你做的事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可沒有替他開脫的意思。他不是個稱職的父親，但這不該妨礙你過一個自己想要的人生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這身武功，你可以當作他送給你的禮物。要是不喜歡，就當是被報了一個不喜歡的興趣班，扔下就是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"追求武學巔峰是他的道，但不一定是你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不討厭這身武功，我當然也有自己的人生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是龍門科技大學機械工程專業的優秀畢業生，是鯉氏偵探事務所的雇員，也是羅德島的外勤幹員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但不是冬青木區大學生行俠仗義第一人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"需要的話，我也可以是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然都想通了，下回見面的時候，把這些話告訴他就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鯉叔，你果然......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"突然打一套好久不練的拳，總歸是有原因的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"話說回來，考慮到他這些年不負責任的行為，你要是不服氣，確實可以去找他打一架。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"輸了也沒關係，他在你這個年紀，也未必就比你厲害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g9_yumensuburb"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（搖頭歎氣）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"停。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看得清楚，勝負已分，是這個小姑娘贏了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接著。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我姑且放你走，等你報完恩，再回來還醫藥費。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截雲","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小子，你的刀也還給你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看出來人家有傷，不還手，輸倒也輸得體面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也沒必要用這種眼神看我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小姑娘答應了我要回來，我信她。她要是言而無信，就是我看錯人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我幫你抓她回來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g8_yumenarena"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以走了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遙夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......為什麼這麼看著我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看起來，沒有受傷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遙夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是意料之外還是失望？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不希望你出事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鬧了一些不必要的誤會，讓你陷入麻煩了，抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才我已經和他們解釋過了，沒事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遙夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"慢著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遙夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才這裡的軍士告訴我，我手裡的那隻袖標——你給我的那一隻，本來是前天從城外帶回來的證物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遙夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不打算解釋一下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你已經知道了，又何必要我來解釋。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"杜遙夜的拳頭停在了半空中，林雨霞也沒有躲閃的意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遙夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們才認識不久，你不相信我也在情理之中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遙夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想要找一個人幫你去查鑄劍坊，我可以同意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遙夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你不該用我朋友的事來騙我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遙夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"停，打住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遙夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你沒資格跟我道歉，我不會原諒你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遙夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是你們龍門人的做事方式？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我自己的做事方式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遙夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遙夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以呢，總不能白白讓你利用這一趟，你查到什麼有用的東西了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遙夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把你知道的事都告訴我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原本只是一些懷疑，現在更加確信了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從城外發現信使隊伍遇襲開始，我們遇到的每件事都充滿蹊蹺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們在鑄劍坊遇到山海眾也並非巧合，這是那位姓孟的刀匠和他們有所勾結的最直接證據。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遙夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的是他......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果有一人，有能力，也有理由一手策劃這些事，那只能是他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遙夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不明白，他為什麼要做這些事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遙夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我朋友的下落，你到底還知道多少？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不清楚，但已經派人去查了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果按最壞的打算來看，不單單是信使隊伍，整座玉門城恐怕都已深陷極大的危險中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但願他的目的不在於此，或者是，還有後手......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g1_yumenstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到底是老了，不中用了。最後一件事，也辦不利索......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
